{"id":244155,"name":"Sheraton 23R, 1BDR","headline":"The 1 BDR Ruby Flatette | 5 min from CAI Airport","summary":"##Space This deep red studio is perfect for small families and business travelers. The studio features a queen size comfortable bed with a work...","description":{"Space":"\r\n\r\nThis deep red studio is perfect for small families and business travelers.  The studio features a queen size comfortable bed with a working desk. It also features a fully loaded kitchenette, microwave, a stove top with cooking utensils, a kettle and a Nespresso coffee machine. Additionally, guests can enjoy a 55 inch smart TV for further personal entertainment.\r\n\r\n","Access":"\r\n\r\nGuests have access to the entire apartment.\r\n\r\n","Interaction":"\r\n\r\nGuests can text and call us anytime they need assistance. We'll be happy to address any issues right away.\r\n\r\n","Neighborhood":"\r\n\r\nThe neighborhood is full of life with plenty of street food options (the apartment is quite and peaceful though) \r\n\r\n- Banks and other services are also within walking distance. \r\n\r\n- Cairo Complex is within 15 min walking distance and is packed with hangouts. \r\n- Giza Pyramids is a 50 min drive\r\n- Downtown Cairo is a 30 min drive \r\n- New Cairo is a 15 min drive\r\n- Cairo International Airport is a 5 min drive.\r\n\r\n","Transit":"\r\n\r\nWe provide concierge services that include airport transfers and private day tours. \r\n\r\nAll places are reachable by car, Uber app and Careem app but if you wish to take a walk it's takes no more than 5 minutes to reach any of the services around.\r\n\r\n","Notes":"\r\n\r\nPlease note the following: \r\n- Smoking is only allowed outside the building (a fine of $100 will be imposed when smoking indoors) \r\n- Visitors are not allowed, only confirmed guests will be granted entry. \r\n- Free of charge street parking is available.\r\n\r\nADDITIONAL CLEANING:\r\n-If you require cleaning during your stay or linen and towel changes, this can be provided at an extra cost. Please contact us to book the service and request quotes."},"city":"Cairo","capacity_of_guests":2,"number_of_bedrooms":1,"number_of_beds":2,"number_of_bathrooms":1,"number_of_stars":5,"location_address1":"81 Ashbelya","location_address2":"","location_lat":"30.1056622","location_lng":"31.3713387","booking_link":null,"airbnb_link":null,"rental_type":"studio","featured":false,"cleaning_fee":15,"checkin_time":15,"checkout_time":11,"booking_sync_cleaning_fee_id":477692,"active":1,"can_book":1,"agreement":"Kindly note that a damage deposit of USD 100 (or the equivalent in EGP) is required. The payment is collected online as part of the reservation payment and will be reimbursed on the checkout day, provided no damages are incurred.\r\n  • Smoking (including shisha) inside the unit is strictly not allowed. However it is allowed in the unit’s balcony (if applicable). A fine of $100 may be imposed in case of smoking indoors.\r\n • Partying, excessive noise and public alcohol drinking is not allowed. In case of violations, security will be notified and appropriate strict actions will be taken. \r\n • Visitors are not allowed, only confirmed guests stated in the reservation will be granted entry. \r\n• Egyptian & Arab couples ONLY are required to provide proof of marriage according to Egyptian law. Guests are required to send their IDs or passports to the email (id@xurustays.com) or (id.elgouna@xurustays.com) as per the local regulations.\r\n• El Gouna entry permits require 48 hours to be issued, in case guest IDs and passports are sent less than 48 hours before check in date, entry permits are subject to delay or may not be granted. (In case of disapproval from community security office, guests will be fully refunded).\r\n • Cancellation more than 30 days before the arrival date, we keep 10% of the total price of the stay.\r\n • Cancellation between 15 days and 30 days before the arrival date, we keep 50% of the total price of the stay. \r\n